        "text": "Extract key details from this receipt image. Return ONLY a valid JSON object with no markdown formatting, no code blocks, and no extra text.\n\n{\n  \"merchant\": \"Store or Vendor Name\",\n  \"amount\": 0.00,\n  \"currency\": \"PHP\",\n  \"receipt_date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n}",
